§ `2. controlled drug, controlled substance, psychoactive substance, excluded substance`

`heroin` MEANS `Substance Facts` WITH
    `the thing is specified in Part 1, 2 or 3 of the First Schedule, or is anything that contains a substance or product so specified` IS TRUE
    `the thing is specified in the Third Schedule` IS FALSE
    `the thing has the capacity to have a psychoactive effect on an individual if the individual smokes, administers to himself or herself or otherwise consumes it` IS TRUE
    `the thing is within a paragraph of Part 1 of the Fifth Schedule other than paragraph 4 (any controlled drug or controlled substance)` IS FALSE
    `a person asserting that the thing is an excluded substance has proved that on a balance of probabilities` IS FALSE

