§ `11D and 11P. instructing; disseminating information`

`taught, knowing` MEANS `Instruction Facts` WITH
    `the accused taught or instructed another person to carry out, or provided him or her with information on carrying out, an activity mentioned in section 11D(1) or 11P(1)` IS TRUE
    `the accused knew or had reason to believe that the other person intended to carry out the activity` IS TRUE
    `the accused disseminated or published, or caused the dissemination or publication of, information on carrying out such an activity` IS FALSE
    `the teaching, instruction, provision, dissemination or publication was authorised under this Act` IS FALSE
    `the accused proves that it had a legitimate purpose related to the administration of justice, the investigation and prosecution of offences, or to science, medicine, education or art` IS FALSE
