§ `12, 13, 14. abetment, attempts, offences abroad, body corporate`

`12 abetted` MEANS `Secondary Liability Facts` WITH
    `the accused abetted the commission of an offence under this Act` IS TRUE
    `the accused attempted to commit an offence under this Act` IS FALSE
    `the accused did an act preparatory to, or in furtherance of, the commission of an offence under this Act` IS FALSE
    `the accused aided, abetted, counselled or procured the commission, in a place outside Singapore, of an offence punishable under a corresponding law in force in that place` IS FALSE
    `the accused did an act preparatory to, or in furtherance of, an act outside Singapore which if committed in Singapore would constitute an offence under this Act` IS FALSE
    `the accused aided, abetted, counselled or procured the commission of an offence under this Act within Singapore, even though all or any of the acts were done outside Singapore` IS FALSE
    `the offence was committed by a body corporate with the consent or connivance of, or was attributable to any neglect on the part of, the accused as a director, manager, secretary or similar officer, or a person purporting to act as one` IS FALSE

